---
description: Team shared-context protocol for the Sisu repo
alwaysApply: true
---
Follow `CLAUDE.md` in the repo root (stack, rules, lanes). In particular its "Shared context" section:
at session start run `sh scripts/context-digest.sh` and read the newest entries in `context/log/`;
before committing a working chunk and at session end, add a new entry using the template in `context/log/README.md`.
